                                                "sense_id": "42608df9-1d37-3a0f-bf9b-b15fc480ad18",
                                                "text": "It was a weary time. A carriage clock had been placed on the discoloured wooden mantelpiece, and slowly its hands crept on from one to two and from two to three."
